DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261130T210000
SUMMARY:AI Salon | Guardie e ladri — Hacker: come attaccano\, come difend
 erci
LOCATION:Acer Europe\, Via della Posta 28\, Bioggio (Lugano)
DESCRIPTION:An Italian- and English-language evening in Ticino on how recen
 t\, well-known cyberattacks actually worked and how generative AI is shift
 ing the balance between attackers and defenders\, with a social-engineerin
 g quiz and a networking aperitif.\n\nOrganiser: AI Salon Ticino\, hosted b
 y Acer Europe\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/even
 ts/ai-salon-guardie-e-ladri-bioggio-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ai-salon-guardie-e-ladri-bioggio-2026
 /
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:swissrn-computational-reproducibility-hackathon-lugano-2026@swissdataev
 ents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261128T140412Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261209T093000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261209T170000
SUMMARY:Computational Reproducibility Hackathon 2026
LOCATION:Università della Svizzera italiana\, Aula Polivalente\, Via la Sa
 nta 1\, Viganello (Lugano)
DESCRIPTION:A one-day hands-on event where participants try to reproduce on
 e another’s analyses\, papers and tools\, then compare notes on what mak
 es computational work hold up\; the SwissRN annual meeting follows the nex
 t day at the same venue.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss Reproducibility Network (Swis
 sRN) with USI\, ETH Zurich and FernUni Schweiz\n\nDetails and registration
 : https://swissdataevents.ch/events/swissrn-computational-reproducibility-
 hackathon-lugano-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/swissrn-computational-reproducibility
 -hackathon-lugano-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
